3. Third-party work that this code uses but does not include
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- ScrollPrize/villa: spiral fitter, lasagna grad_mag, VC3D formats (MIT). Used at the commits named in the notes.
- scrollprize/surface_m7_nnunet: surface model whose masks are the chain input (Apache-2.0, Hugging Face).
- tf-kelly/scrolls: Kelly's winding index for Scroll 4 patches (code MIT; its data has its own terms). Only
  eval/kelly_h2h.py reads its published outputs, which are not included. No code is copied.
- Stevens' Scroll 4 patches, HercuViT, dinovol, and other public surface models: evaluated in notes/, not included.
- The spiral-fit recipe overrides used by spiral/run_arm.sh come from the published PHerc. 343 spiral-fit recipe
  (Nieuwlaar). They are not included (see README.md).
